# Publication secret scan

The public snapshot excludes installation configuration, runtime data, database dumps, private Git history, and internal deployment reports. Doctor restoration baselines are regenerated from the public files.

The `admindemo` / `AdminDemoPassword` pair is an intentionally public demo credential. It is accepted only when demo mode is enabled.

Run `scripts/check-forbidden-files.sh` and `scripts/check-secrets.sh` before publishing changes.
